### ==============================================================================
### ShopCraft API - Day 06 Part 2: Refresh Token Mechanism & Rotation HTTP Verification
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Register New Account (Returns 201 Created with Access Token & Refresh Token)
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "part2.tester@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Part Two Tester"
}

### Store Initial Refresh Token
@initialRefreshToken = {{registerUser.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 2. Login to Obtain Access Token & Refresh Token
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "part2.tester@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Login Refresh Token
@loginRefreshToken = {{userLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}
@accessToken = {{userLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3. Access Protected Endpoint with Short-Lived Access Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Exchange Refresh Token for New Token Pair (Rotation)
# @name refreshTokenCall
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginRefreshToken}}"
}

### Store Rotated Refresh Token and New Access Token
@rotatedRefreshToken = {{refreshTokenCall.response.body.refreshToken}}
@newAccessToken = {{refreshTokenCall.response.body.token}}

### 5. Access Protected Endpoint with New Access Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{newAccessToken}}

### 6. Reuse Old (Rotated) Refresh Token (Expect 401 Unauthorized & Token Reuse Detection)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginRefreshToken}}"
}

### 7. User Logout (Revokes Active Refresh Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{rotatedRefreshToken}}"
}

### 8. Attempt Refresh with Revoked Token (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{rotatedRefreshToken}}"
}
